---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import ProjectCard from "../components/ProjectCard.astro";
import PostList from "../components/PostList.astro";
import {publishedPosts} from "../lib/posts";
const posts = await publishedPosts();
---
<Layout title="개발 기록과 프로젝트 — DEVLOG"><section class="hero wrap"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> BUILD · LEARN · SHARE</p><h1>개발 기록.<br><em>프로젝트와 코드.</em></h1><p class="intro">스터디 내용 정리. 프로젝트 구현과 검증.<br>웹 시연과 GitHub 소스 공개.</p><a class="button" href="#projects">프로젝트 보기 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><p class="hero-foot">AI NATIVE <span>/</span> WEB <span>/</span> MOBILE <span>/</span> SERVER</p></div>
<div class="hero-art" aria-label="요청에서 구현과 검증으로 이어지는 개발 흐름"><div class="art-grid"></div><div class="art-top"><span>THE DEVELOPMENT LOOP</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><div class="orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="flow-note note-one"><span class="mini-icon">#</span><div><small>01 · REQUEST</small><strong>요청</strong></div></div><div class="flow-note note-two"><span class="mini-icon code-icon">&lt;/&gt;</span><div><small>02 · BUILD</small><strong>구현</strong></div></div><div class="flow-note note-three"><span class="mini-icon check-icon">✓</span><div><small>03 · VERIFY</small><strong>검증</strong></div></div><div class="art-bottom"><span class="dot"></span> 요청 → 구현 → 검증</div></div></section>
<section class="wrap section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">STUDY NOTES</p><h2>최근 학습 기록</h2></div><a href="/studies/">모든 글 보기 →</a></div><PostList posts={posts.slice(0, 3)} /></section><section class="projects wrap section" id="projects" aria-labelledby="projects-title"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">SELECTED WORK</p><h2 id="projects-title">프로젝트<span class="count">01</span></h2></div><span class="section-aside">Slack–Codex 연동</span></div><ProjectCard /><p class="collection-note"><a href="/projects/">프로젝트 모아보기 →</a></p></section>
<section id="approach" class="approach section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">BEHIND THE WORK</p><h2>기록 관리</h2></div><p class="approach-intro">Notion · GitHub · 홈페이지</p></div><div class="approach-grid"><article><span class="number">01 / PROCESS</span><h3>Notion</h3><p>학습 메모, 설계 초안, 진행 기록.</p></article><article><span class="number">02 / SOURCE</span><h3>GitHub</h3><p>소스 코드, 변경 이력, 검증 결과.</p></article><article><span class="number">03 / EXPERIENCE</span><h3>블로그와 쇼케이스</h3><p>공개 학습 글, 프로젝트 소개, 웹 시연.</p></article></div></div></section></Layout>